UPDATE public.frequencies SET description = 'A soft tone commonly used to support a feeling of restoration after a busy day. It sits low enough to be felt as a gentle, settling vibration, without the heaviness of the deepest tones. In a vibroacoustic session it is often chosen when the body feels worn rather than wound up, when the aim is quiet renewal instead of stimulation. Many people describe it as a soft reset, a way of letting the system come back to itself before rest.' WHERE hz = 285;